  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BigQueryOASIS v2.0.3\n\nGoogle BigQuery OASIS Provider - serverless data warehouse for OASIS holons and avatars via the BigQuery .NET client. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Bind BigQuery record values through official named query parameters (9831a75)\n- Bind BigQuery saves to original jobs and preserve caller and bulk outcomes (6390053)\n- Exclude soft-deleted BigQuery avatar details from ordinary reads (417d2ed)\n- Fix BigQuery complete collections and canonical record roundtrips (703cfe3)\n- fix: expose cloud capabilities for Cosmos Firestore and BigQuery (82d92cc)\n- fix: reject invalid BigQuery parent options before alias queries (9d2f298)\n- Implement BigQuery parent-linked reads with shared graph projection (64c157c)\n- Implement captured BigQuery graph writes with conditional role preservation (42625ad)\n- Implement historical BigQuery search and version-scoped exports (d925628)\n- Implement provider-owned BigQuery AvatarDetail soft and hard deletion (484d71f)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Preserve BigQuery record archives through conditional save and soft-delete lifecycle (d74a4af)\n- Reject ambiguous BigQuery point record selectors (9c767ee)\n- Reject misbound BigQuery selectors and invalid record identities (544c900)\n- Replace divergent BigQuery search with shared validated search contract (b7a33b2)\n- Require bound BigQuery delete acknowledgements and preserve reconciliation (384eea0)\n- Reuse shared BigQuery metadata matcher and honor root type filters (7857095)\n- Select exact BigQuery record versions through shared history decoder (9b37c94)\n- Verify selected graph save admission and acknowledged membership publication (e22fe31)\n- Wire BigQuery provider-key search exports and import outcomes to shared owners (c5b2608)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.BigQueryOASIS",
